text-align:left;\"><span class=\"npc\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mortimer\">Mortimer</a></span>: <span class=\"msg\">They referred to it as 'the cave' and said the entrance is hidden. They also mentioned sand and two mossy stones. I hope that helps. I wish you luck.</span><br/></div><br/></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p>You can only enter this cave after starting mission 5 of <a href=\"#/quest/the-isle-of-evil-quest\">The Isle of Evil Quest</a> and thus being premium. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a> prevents formerly premium players to enter.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>The Cave NPCs (1 NPC)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Bearded%20Woman\">A Bearded Woman</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Bearded%20Woman\"><img alt=\"A Bearded Woman\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/A_Bearded_Woman_d522b4.gif\" width=\"120\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Artist</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">East of <a href=\"#/wiki/Northport\">Northport</a>, in <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Cave</strong></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"te